❗️ Last night, the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation, in response to terrorist attacks launched by the Kiev regime against civilian infrastructure on the territory of the Russian Federation, carried out a massive strike with long-range ground-, air-, sea-launched precision weapons and strike unmanned aerial vehicles, which hit enterprises of the defence industry, fuel and power facilities in Kiev and Kiev region as well as infrastructure of military airfields in Dnepropetrovsk, Poltava, Cherkassy, Chernigov, and Kiev regions.

📍  The following targets were hit in Kiev:

▪️  the Kiev-71 Industrial Enterprise (Abris-PT Production Association), which is one of Ukraine's key enterprises specialising in the development and production of long-range and medium-range reconnaissance unmanned aerial vehicles such as Strela, Mara, Sirko, Avenger, Elf-K, Flight Arrow, FPV-drone Shrike-10 as well as telemetry, electronic, and optical equipment;

▪️ the Kiev-1 Electronics Serial Production Plant (Kievskiy-Burevestnik State Enterprise), which manufactures long-range and medium-range unmanned aerial vehicles as well as develop and produce radar equipment for the Armed Forces of Ukraine;

▪️ the Kiev-79 Industrial Enterprise (UKR ARMO TECH LLC). It is one of the key manufacturers and suppliers of armoured vehicles and armoured elements for AFU hardware as well as warheads (munitions) for different types of missiles and UAVs;

▪️ the Kiev Shipyard (Kuznya on Rybalsky Privately Held Company) which is the largest mechanical engineering enterprise manufacturing project 58155 Gyurza-M artillery boats as well as producing and repairing strike uncrewed surface vehicles;

▪️  the Kiev-1 Instrument Engineering Plant (Kvant factory). It is a key scientific and production base that manufacture fire control systems, electro-optical active protection systems, navigation assets, and automatics for the Ukrainian Air Force and Navy including the Neptune-MD guided missiles.

📍  In Kiev region, the following targets are engaged:

▪️  The Zhulyany missile unit and component plant (State Enterprise (Vizar Machine-Building Plant LLC). It is a state enterprise of the Ukrainian defence industry that produces, maintains, and repairs anti-aircraft missile systems, aircraft technologies, and air defence components, and long-range fixed-wing unmanned aerial vehicles. As a result of the strike, a repeated large detonation is recorded;

▪️ the Vishnevoye POL depot (Nefteeksperimentalnoye KP) which is a key experimental industrial establishment and technical engineering base specialising in the design and maintenance of petrol stations tank fields. Gasoline and diesel stored there are employed for the emergency delivery of fuel into the combat zone.

🔹 Russian Defence Ministry

